      "title": "Critical Consensus: \"The Da Vinci Code\" Is Dull | Rotten Tomatoes",
      "snippet": "The big screen adaptation of Dan Brown's novel \"The Da Vinci Code\" is a major disappointment, with only 16% of the nation's critics recommending the movie as of this writing. One of the problems, critics say, is that the movie is too slavishly faithful to the book, making it a poorly paced, dull, and only occasionally thrilling experience.",
